			"updated": 1772865271857,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "| Feature      | ACID    | BASE                      |\n| ------------ | ------- | ------------------------- |\n| Consistency  | Strong  | Eventual                  |\n| Availability | Lower   | High                      |\n| Scalability  | Limited | Very High                 |\n| Use Case     | Banking | Large distributed systems |",
